      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C65C0020ADF8B7ECACE00020C788C5B4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "왜 한숨을 쉬고 있어?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C65C0020D55CC228C7440020C26CACE00020C788C5B4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안샤는 정말 대단한 것 같지 않아?\n레쿠쟈를 만나겠다는 꿈도 이뤘잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C0E4B2940020C815B9D00020B300B2E8D55C0020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC544003F000AB808CFE0C7C8B97C0020B9CCB098ACA0B2E4B2940020AFC8B3C40020C774B918C796C544002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일 있어?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77C0020C788C5B4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고민이 있으면 들어 줄게",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0BBFCC7740020C788C73CBA740020B4E4C5B40020C904AC8C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "룸 셰어를 하던 친구가 기획사 오디션에\n붙었다는 이야기는 전에 했지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8F80020C170C5B4B97C0020D558B3580020CE5CAD6CAC000020AE30D68DC0AC0020C624B514C158C5D0000ABD99C5C8B2E4B2940020C774C57CAE30B2940020C804C5D00020D588C9C0003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거기에 나한테는 엄마가 다른 오빠...\n쉽게 말해 이복오빠가 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE30C5D00020B098D55CD14CB2940020C5C4B9C8AC000020B2E4B9780020C624BE60002E002E002E000AC27DAC8C0020B9D0D5740020C774BCF5C624BE60AC000020C788C5B4002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오빠가 있어?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624BE60AC000020C788C5B4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 사람인데?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020C0ACB78CC778B370003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "티에르노라는 사람인데...\n만난 적도, 이야기를 나눈 적도 없지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그 사람도 댄서로 활약하고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2F0C5D0B974B178B77CB2940020C0ACB78CC778B370002E002E002E000AB9CCB09C0020C801B3C4002C0020C774C57CAE30B97C0020B098B2080020C801B3C40020C5C6C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE00000AADF80020C0ACB78CB3C40020B304C11CB85C0020D65CC57DD558ACE00020C788C5B4002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 나도 이대로 있으면 안 된다고\n괜히 압박감이 느껴지는 거 있지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B098B3C40020C774B300B85C0020C788C73CBA740020C5480020B41CB2E4ACE0000AAD1CD7880020C555BC15AC10C7740020B290AEF4C9C0B2940020AC700020C788C9C0002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부담 가질 필요 없어",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80B2F40020AC00C9C80020D544C6940020C5C6C5B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루디는 루디야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8B514B2940020B8E8B514C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇게 말해 줘서 기쁘긴 하지만,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 강한 트레이너니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자연스럽게 자신감이 나오는 거 아닐까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AC8C0020B9D0D5740020C918C11C0020AE30C058AE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C000A001000020100000000100002190000010020AC15D55C0020D2B8B808C774B108B2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC790C5F0C2A4B7FDAC8C0020C790C2E0AC10C7740020B098C624B2940020AC700020C544B2D0AE4C003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다면...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4BA74002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n갑작스럽지만 나와 승부해 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너와 괜찮은 승부를 할 수 있다면\n나도 자신감이 생길 것 같아서 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 늘 연습하는 곳에서 기다리고 있을게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020B2980020C5F0C2B5D558B2940020ACF3C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C744AC8C002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n나와 승부해 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AB098C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
