      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루디!\n정말 굉장했어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8B5140021000AC815B9D00020AD49C7A5D588C5B4002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코르니 씨!?\n언제부터 계셨던 거예요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54B974B2C80020C5280021003F000AC5B8C81CBD80D1300020ACC4C168B3580020AC70C608C694003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부가 막 시작됐을 때였나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80AC000020B9C90020C2DCC791B410C7440020B54CC600B098003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 어쩌다 둘이\n승부를 하게 된 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020C5B4CA4CB2E40020B458C774000AC2B9BD80B97C0020D558AC8C0020B41C0020AC70C57C003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 압박감을 좀 느끼고 있어서요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그래서 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 상대로\n괜찮은 승부를 하면 자신감이 생길까 하고...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C555BC15AC10C7440020C8800020B290B07CACE00020C788C5B4C11CC694002E002E002E00100001BE01000AADF8B798C11C0020001000020100000000100002190000020020C0C1B300B85C000AAD1CCC2EC7400020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558BA740020C790C2E0AC10C7740020C0DDAE38AE4C0020D558ACE0002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루디는 이미 굉장한 사람이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8B514B2940020C774BBF80020AD49C7A5D55C0020C0ACB78CC774C57C002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "루디는 MZ단의 멤버로서\n미르에 사는 모두를 구했었잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B8E8B514B2940020004D005AB2E8C7580020BA64BC84B85CC11C000ABBF8B974C5D00020C0ACB2940020BAA8B450B97C0020AD6CD588C5C8C796C544002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말도 안 되게 강한 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003>\n좋은 쪽으로 이상한 거지,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n루디는 정말 굉장한 사람이라구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0B3C40020C5480020B418AC8C0020AC15D55C002000100002010000000010000219000003000AC88BC7400020CABDC73CB85C0020C774C0C1D55C0020AC70C9C0002C00100001BE00000AB8E8B514B2940020C815B9D00020AD49C7A5D55C0020C0ACB78CC774B77CAD6C002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "게다가 너와 아쿠스타의 호흡이 척척 맞는\n댄스는 너희 둘만의 무기잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC8CB2E4AC000020B108C6400020C544CFE0C2A4D0C0C7580020D638D761C7740020CC99CC990020B9DEB294000AB304C2A4B2940020B108D76C0020B458B9CCC7580020BB34AE30C796C544002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코르니 씨...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54B974B2C80020C528002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 막 계승자가 되었을 때는\n루디 너처럼 압박감을 느꼈었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40020B9C90020ACC4C2B9C790AC000020B418C5C8C7440020B54CB294000AB8E8B5140020B108CC98B7FC0020C555BC15AC10C7440020B290AF08C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화에 대한 건\n지금도 모르는 것투성이니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D55C0020AC74000AC9C0AE08B3C40020BAA8B974B2940020AC83D22CC131C774B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "계승자로서 무엇을 물려줘야 할지\n고민하곤 했거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
